@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
@periodId = 1
@hocKyId = 1

### List grade input periods
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/grade-input-periods
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### List grade input periods by term
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/grade-input-periods?hoc_ky_id={{hocKyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create grade input period
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/grade-input-periods
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "hoc_ky_id": {{hocKyId}},
  "starts_at": "2026-06-01 08:00:00",
  "ends_at": "2026-06-30 17:00:00",
  "status": "open"
}

### Validation case bad date order, expect 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/grade-input-periods
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "hoc_ky_id": {{hocKyId}},
  "starts_at": "2026-06-30 17:00:00",
  "ends_at": "2026-06-01 08:00:00",
  "status": "open"
}

### Update grade input period
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/grade-input-periods/{{periodId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "hoc_ky_id": {{hocKyId}},
  "starts_at": "2026-06-01 08:00:00",
  "ends_at": "2026-07-15 17:00:00",
  "status": "closed"
}

### Delete grade input period
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/grade-input-periods/{{periodId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
